  "implemented": [
    "Finite private purchase jobs persist independently accepted pool/directory/operator/generation/tariff, byte/price/window and native fee limits in the encrypted payer book",
    "Per-job receipt identities and stable phase request IDs derive locally from the original wallet; native relayer signing keys and witnesses are never sent to operators",
    "Shared PrivateExchange transport connects the native scheduler to the CA/SPKI-pinned HTTPS client without introducing a node/client dependency cycle",
    "Bounded canonical index sync drives local proving, durable native signing, real node submission, canonical reconciliation and original-epoch receipt evidence",
    "Restart searches the bounded native journal before rebasing or purchasing, including transactions committed before the scheduler submission step",
    "Exact queued envelopes retransmit through the healthy owned staging pool without another nonce/fee or changes to native duplicate admission",
    "Private replies are authenticated and checked against local consent before caching; a receipt credit must match the exact canonical note",
    "Canonical directory offer facts are exposed read-only for independently constructing payer consent"
  ],
